// Portable placeholder for output configuration.
//
// The main Niri config always includes this file so the config remains valid on
// machines without a host-specific monitor layout.
//
// On this laptop, install/host.sh replaces this file with a symlink to:
//   hosts/acer-laptop/niri/display.kdl
//
// To inspect current output names/modes:
//   niri msg outputs
